{"words": [{"text": "وَلِكُلٍّۢ", "translation": "And for everyone"}, {"text": "وِجْهَةٌ", "translation": "(is) a direction "}, {"text": "هُوَ", "translation": "he"}, {"text": "مُوَلِّيهَا ۖ", "translation": "turns towards it"}, {"text": "فَٱسْتَبِقُوا۟", "translation": "so race"}, {"text": "ٱلْخَيْرَٰتِ ۚ", "translation": "(to) the good"}, {"text": "أَيْنَ", "translation": "Wherever"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "تَكُونُوا۟", "translation": "you will be"}, {"text": "يَأْتِ", "translation": "will bring"}, {"text": "بِكُمُ", "translation": "you"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "(by) Allah"}, {"text": "جَمِيعًا ۚ", "translation": "together"}, {"text": "إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "(is) on"}, {"text": "كُلِّ", "translation": "every"}, {"text": "شَىْءٍۢ", "translation": "thing"}, {"text": "قَدِيرٌۭ", "translation": "All-Powerful"}], "sahih": "For each [religious following] is a [prayer] direction toward which it faces. So race to [all that is] good. Wherever you may be, Allāh will bring you forth [for judgement] all together. Indeed, Allāh is over all things competent."}